mode gui

# output
plugin enter output
panel
show
~

# system
plugin enter system
panel
rect 20 20 40 40
show
~

# weather
plugin enter weather
add Xindian District
add Xinzhuang District
add Tainan
add Tokyo
add Eindhoven
~

# device
plugin enter device
panel
show
~

# wol
plugin enter wol
add linds 90:09:d0:64:4e:a4
~